      <Placemark>
        <name>Castaway Native Huts</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Contact No. 09686057756                  Castaway Native Huts offers a rustic island escape right in the heart of Port Barton, perfect for travelers who want to experience authentic Palawan living. The property features charming bamboo huts with native-style interiors, cozy beds, and private verandas where guests can relax and enjoy the peaceful surroundings. Each hut is designed with traditional materials, giving you a true tropical vibe while still providing comfort. <br>id: ]]></description>
