        <name>Eashanti’s Place</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiRkkaw5o3Irg-gigdVorwwRrijoSQpRV7uOFJ73iHpZ64oPSZ8km1B1KDzynbQsGoipZIjSNcfVvsqshujhYKYBYl4gLdRyPKNS5SoxOg1Ft-qCoYvuxJjdsbVuTyXfROIdchA-EjGhQcqCRja5S7Iq9vymCSSjuwnfyMSUbW4r3zNBB_MuFADqBiWsK2m644JNVZWF71tY92caPkbDSUC_QZX8NEnwIM-ERUOYlI030NlkTgNDySKY6c?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0916 678 2681                      Eashanti's Place in Port Barton: Eashantis Place offers an inn experience in Port Barton, Philippines. Guests enjoy a beautiful garden and terrace, complemented by free WiFi throughout the property.<br><br>Comfortable Accommodation: Rooms feature air-conditioning, private bathrooms with bidets, free toiletries, and showers. Additional amenities include balconies, terraces, and outdoor seating areas.<br><br>Convenient Facilities: The inn provides private check-in and check-out, a paid shuttle service, shared kitchen, bicycle parking, room service, and bike hire. Free on-site private parking is available.<br><br>Nearby Attractions: Port Barton Beach is less than 1 km away, while Pamuayan Beach is 2 km distant. San Vicente Airport is 74 km from the property. Highly rated for its attentive staff and excellent service support.<br>id: <br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZi8Bu3wi1QUMMA3cfq02TmNLYiD2sLKv-PdXFE-IBIF2HAT72N6IhB0pRn0ssynRpWxyJqXPpGX7qzjMHN6jcXQJ7fJnWf-plE9m7V71_Bg4xCaX422v71q10Mj827PM_w8TU__4QFe7u9ZImIOq_VcTaqxUUK_MGNmh8tZaK8Gbuenz4gj8keecRhMk-hUd9rGKY6Lt_s5QaPRH6nXiiDll6c5-N1ihjrJOn4B4_k_qDkEHBJyxtNVDEw?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Contact No: 0916 678 2681                      Eashanti's Place in Port Barton: Eashantis Place offers an inn experience in Port Barton, Philippines. Guests enjoy a beautiful garden and terrace, complemented by free WiFi throughout the property.

Comfortable Accommodation: Rooms feature air-conditioning, private bathrooms with bidets, free toiletries, and showers. Additional amenities include balconies, terraces, and outdoor seating areas.

Convenient Facilities: The inn provides private check-in and check-out, a paid shuttle service, shared kitchen, bicycle parking, room service, and bike hire. Free on-site private parking is available.

Nearby Attractions: Port Barton Beach is less than 1 km away, while Pamuayan Beach is 2 km distant. San Vicente Airport is 74 km from the property. Highly rated for its attentive staff and excellent service support.]]></value>
          </Data>
