        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZg4oNP82ZtqxCiuwtZApipPEstcp6SNrOBnxwKgMrOAn96xYK5-kDSwSyM2b53GqMhEBPXahahvBVfqTd-s3vz6TmTewuw_Khwh4iYp-z8YumemzNEEqi1B70H36ZBqY1kNCZBOmY28zYUuzJA7D0aKMKR6cU8pLoZfcqW-boqMb_tZLLB2442XlUwwmBu_6bqhfZPb8tYQ6CSOcdWPW-QgWHz3XxD1hFc1XM394KhtGlaPmt6wZKL6VJ4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0921 599 3953                      Escape to paradise at this beachfront haven, nestled under swaying coconut palms on the serene, untouched shores of Pamuayan Beach.<br><br>With 2 km of pristine coastline, it's the ultimate hideaway for couples or anyone seeking peace and tranquility . The Bungalow is thoughtfully designed for ultimate comfort.<br><br>Its light, airy construction invites a refreshing tropical breeze, making you feel completely immersed in the beauty of the tropics.<br>id: <br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZj9kVkE2ZLn2IVyJXkP6W3yKox27ky4UF_4woyuqw1LSskOush1OhkNXsZDmRkd7VcKrBMDJMQ_PgXOJtCmHcHTpMNoWAi9RCOux6dSxNn3c5l785P03SGCptwSheK4p2QfZw3k0em17PI0MyyUKSynIJQr0j-ozOl3rfUVPJgDNIKg8G-rF8RCd_EKNVjQgykatN0s-JeVf-n12lqybE8mLVySWCk6uxSZm475vyhuXQpkNG3LkGFv54Y?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjaDxEW9dEGdN0l7SpLCY74kYY-9_aPVJn0F0t6r5h4T4NglWoM5G4XqdJ9GdpY0yzQ6_fPK_kxIII9mDcMBSIuzdRyvFG7kqPIbmw_WvvyfvKOJFgKtXHubG6bx9PWRJTBFUMgUvb8N7X9BwYfz6gZCUzfij-6L96edBEXnbNdVO52eLaBYWYY0T2DZzJaYrynH87Jy1IngJ6pNTTJ0GxZu2lqa3_j_A89s4pWKSFTQh3Laery2dg6LO8?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
