          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Contact No: 0921 599 3953                      Escape to paradise at this beachfront haven, nestled under swaying coconut palms on the serene, untouched shores of Pamuayan Beach.

With 2 km of pristine coastline, it's the ultimate hideaway for couples or anyone seeking peace and tranquility . The Bungalow is thoughtfully designed for ultimate comfort.

Its light, airy construction invites a refreshing tropical breeze, making you feel completely immersed in the beauty of the tropics.]]></value>
