      <Placemark>
        <name>Ferranco Tourist Inn</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Contact No: 0915-837-4482 Ferranco Tourist Inn is a 1-star inn located in Port Barton, Palawan, Philippines. The inn boasts a beautiful garden and terrace, providing a peaceful and relaxing environment for guests. With free Wi-Fi available, guests can easily stay connected during their stay. The 24-hour front desk ensures that guests receive the assistance they need throughout their visit.<br><br>The rooms at Ferranco Tourist Inn are comfortably furnished, featuring a seating area and a desk. Some rooms also include a kitchen with a fridge and stovetop, offering guests the convenience of preparing their own meals. Certain rooms even come with a balcony, providing a stunning mountain view.<br>id: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-C2185B</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0915-837-4482 Ferranco Tourist Inn is a 1-star inn located in Port Barton, Palawan, Philippines. The inn boasts a beautiful garden and terrace, providing a peaceful and relaxing environment for guests. With free Wi-Fi available, guests can easily stay connected during their stay. The 24-hour front desk ensures that guests receive the assistance they need throughout their visit.

The rooms at Ferranco Tourist Inn are comfortably furnished, featuring a seating area and a desk. Some rooms also include a kitchen with a fridge and stovetop, offering guests the convenience of preparing their own meals. Certain rooms even come with a balcony, providing a stunning mountain view.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="id">
            <value/>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
