      <Placemark>
        <name>Garpeza Tourist Inn</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhO06NK9MwfX1Abv1Oj5Zak6Ou4nvGmmmJiYeb95MPKZoPj4VyNzHVAnuFgzCQSV1cQ8mi5bAhYQPf8Xd4W2Tgn4xvZ4y1o_6O6Xjh3zUmH0GOQ1xDRjk16CtaLCC7Kmudou6z-buuEPEfrwRMRkSKpjyah3LYqdeHqJe-gCEB-AZeJusJuJ0Hkwtsw_SruTNQOQfSlTVN9CravU2ZKH2OLU1qkiYGpTakFIDcFck36MRyP21djKHCFGnw?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0927 391 3456             Welcome to Garpeza Backpackers! Located in the heart of Port Barton, Palawan, we offer a relaxed and social atmosphere for travelers. Our chill area features board games, foosball, a video game system, and reliable Starlink WIFI. Enjoy your favorite drinks at our small bar or explore the nearby bars without sacrificing a good night's sleep. We're close to the best restaurants and offer a variety of room options to fit your budget. <br><br>Plus, with two backup water systems, you'll always have a refreshing shower after a day of exploring. Need to arrange island hopping, motorbike rental, or transportation? We've got you covered. <br>id: 1<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZh_0CpntYVyWetBYkZOZWEfxQpqR9QUsME1IPDxaQNT-MUjSroEU1rcdSUS1soIwNLccAi-yq01VY1yLykYzrA94I9veeq3hByhbabWJgUbFeVSBuMoUX4JPEybTs8cM2luQXG3_G21adRxDcgO3wqH9MrYrd2Ig6Q9BZ917A1Cjduel-s-y2Why2cIu72qj9RTM-ezct0AAIUdtRMKsmTKX6olN4u7_Q6llcLHqqve6Ev1NT4i4aMzcXk?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZivdl9a0djcy8hmlwKj2nMM975D5pF9UDTc5azMiDxCPyesLclus4JldPQsPVrum3pLDWtMeE9FbLWla73KtApbe_Nh9hAajY3B2ovvI7xfwCM0CQ7FuB-gevoOwnUqObAnEEHqqAq_3vFT79AAev503zKVs343Oxx8S2LOMkNWGIhQdkkJg8TIl4OE7G-DPGfJ6xD_97KFR0PQ8iQnF_SljL6szgMGr-m63f85v0XbmNsfSI5HkPvEuC8?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZggTYmdreECjskH2U9rOijfxwBq1IwBDYqvFaCPSgaTz6ui7XY2T