        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Contact No: 0927 391 3456             Welcome to Garpeza Backpackers! Located in the heart of Port Barton, Palawan, we offer a relaxed and social atmosphere for travelers. Our chill area features board games, foosball, a video game system, and reliable Starlink WIFI. Enjoy your favorite drinks at our small bar or explore the nearby bars without sacrificing a good night's sleep. We're close to the best restaurants and offer a variety of room options to fit your budget. 

Plus, with two backup water systems, you'll always have a refreshing shower after a day of exploring. Need to arrange island hopping, motorbike rental, or transportation? We've got you covered. ]]></value>
