      <Placemark>
        <name>Hashtag Tourist Inn</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZheYZNDvoYVheBKjpbAvai84OrsZnshUyVuSMdilJMnFh8_Kmxa6xFYd2Nw1KhkwzIaCV23HIP1_0qkub4sBRAqomGqBW4Y5j4p2IzPJZgGwTkuEFr6JVNDojEIBlenBziMoGfvEVKz70cu9oyUVqncynvhke9IiwPw9XgqWXDD1W4oy_lIM0H9indYCQoA59pOwG4F4QqomP1yTt9eIMPNSEowVI30skLY11EsKMhi0RVxc4kFOy5EiL8?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0926 749 9058                  Escape to the tranquil shores of San Vicente, Philippines and discover the hidden gem of Hashtag Tourist Inn. Nestled on Bonifacio corner Malvar Street in Port Barton, Palawan, this charming inn offers a peaceful retreat just steps away from the pristine Port Barton Beach.                                      Relax in one of the inn's thoughtfully appointed rooms, each offering a serene garden view from a private patio. Stay connected with complimentary Wi-Fi throughout Hashtag Tourist Inn, and take advantage of free private parking for added convenience.<br>id: <br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjVLuxtQjhl2LdE_JCJZv5dYcKk61Oat8f7-3-q3X2vA52Vx2RfetzM4BdWTJrsUNB83G1QWuA3bKMnWl9h5NRJTkuwzfTc9HjHqfFkbFntOCdTMmW28vvThBlQqFV1u6qrSfCYNuGYZ1F8l0SJ-u0KCuG_84ghZBxjYSFkvojtQSyl5GLWQ3w7aKriNHRFacIGyVdcyPlcinLnltCGG247__Ko774APGXEvdZurXbDuCxn2NPdsHzyq9g?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgwBxsYnGu0jJq2arFFub_1HcE8rct-8r2cxSjQU3k4rteWosknvb0W7B54-YN4gjquFsAECE8yGj4nNp8q8iRr-YwWcqZAf69xAA8GqQTzicEIm1wM5zJjv9ED8QyC2v4iI8NlXuoXGTPM43MOEGiZDkHVeiDxMwh3Y-5UFJI7_b1EnQlw_HsZJlNGszvbnjtkNGFKJkIJFcTM57c1g_tN3c_cWqCX9jyvWryb5nW6fJk_LMq6gqw3YmE?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-C2185B</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Contact No: 0926 749 9058                  Escape to the tranquil shores of San Vicente, Philippines and discover the hidden gem of Hashtag Tourist Inn. Nestled on Bonifacio corner Malvar Street in Port Barton, Palawan, this charming inn offers a peaceful retreat just steps away from the pristine Port Barton Beach.                                      Relax in one of the inn's thoughtfully appointed rooms, each offering a serene garden view from a private patio. Stay connected with complimentary Wi-Fi throughout Hashtag Tourist Inn, and take advantage of free private parking for added convenience.]]></value>
