        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjh93QPZNIdecXr4xfQ7K5kns42QFtuJbb0HR364ii-5SDxp2g4GowQqY2gzlIzfGebBn_bIoBTF4I7G7dvdC_RlaCNtE1Qdqahr6Hx1NkUvFLkusC5Gsmx7SgVHVpu7FsNeHVeSaJLWplrGMtNk8RVsxXUkYOPwh-l-eTigPpdWmwTon1afsBBFOib0-JcmMrRXgbZKAY03P1gfLj25cntPySxYf-MRAatEcjSv-af9s4dKtIwpcBqCEs?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0920 422 3698                      Holiday Suites Port Barton Palawan is a Beach Resort with Thirty Spacious Rooms which is located at the beautiful beach of Port Barton, San Vicente, Palawan. It features a spectacular view of a wide sand beach and clear water where you can enjoy and relax.<br><br>Be extremely relaxed with the overlooking view of a beachfront from our clean and comfortable space accommodation.                              Witness the breathtaking view of a sunset while having your sumptuous moment at our pool side Restaurant and Bar. <br>id: 3<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjlSjH3FGhLJknLKyyjIVnR5dYvfkp98nP0xsFp0ilAFfpeAlP-g09YD2XtlHa0wy1oNCWfQx1xm6a2kT0mdJ-3CuoIX5gyNOvO9fVLSeuiP9gMMwmxYPoZhBs0_XFkKuEQ468aQ9meS9THhuDLAaSXsJ4GunI_lvdLvSng9nuNm_-TSFFDMwCk7J0Rdqe-rYE-Q-YUqj0DQgj8LMsaP2BzOZ7AS4Br2fqn4PLz9l3NNLMlM-zBZEFJ7Rk?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZj9vQqP_bZe9iysYt40JqKq63zegvMTz4Q4EqeC7z_FPfeMDQlX0kmH3W1JdMLjHwYNWJw94sRqAx1ZjUT1MB99OKhwSWLVZFFzhGYtmD-too3lRrug6MRHe7os2eCsSEyafEL2fYpe3mMk14iT01WxZZEgBVob_55CZGVs8Vavjq9wjS_bpCFVjWommw-biAj9B_1OjiPR509Lkcq7PHyi5bmmb7EYvAYESJt8YBhvAguExNA7Byndiyc?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgcEnk3PF8hJrdXAQpMkuLsKAGTmnvRHDtt74UalCCk9re2j70O57pNYOjr7uu2Zo9WQ6Gjz1NNbKzvkyWHaZ1F-D_pXNmB6RhrNEK2k_nVZ32c7AVDisl5oZO-qjp256DB05X0EIkl2U3h0g_gbsTVBsnxw_h