        <name>Hotel Oasis Port Barton Inc.</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZg7KJ1asL32ILN5e8PQVWqkUXEs6BtGc2LlRnSnxiS2zKb5q9sC2WWxisCzmeRxdDXN8hikDl580OKwn9ggPLIFEQEI96Y3iO8J-OtU8Txcquxr21pRPnR_sOVzUlRZVNyIaK3tp_lBbxksKPAutoYeWNtoCWgEUEhcF19ghmSsYXVCYob02xEpS3KqPX34wSl1NevXt2pD8KebhN5LAaHGnn19phBmwONpLAZ7QhOr_kOYQsSSRFreBzY?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0919 595 9869                      Hotel Oasis Port Barton is a 16-room property located in the center of Port Barton. The hotel is a 2-minute walk from Itaytay Beach, 18-minute walking distance from Pamuayan Beach and 1.6 miles away from White Beach.<br><br>Hotel Oasis Port Barton provides accommodations with a restaurant, free private parking, a bar, billiard and football table and a shared lounge. Our 3-star hotel also offers room service, free breakfast, free-flowing coffee, a concierge service and free WiFi.<br>Our bar & restaurant offers Filipino, Thai, International & Swiss dishes and is open to accommodate you from 6am to 10pm.<br>Countless coconut palms, walks along the beach, and boat trips to the surrounding islands are part of the daily routine here. We also offer our guests one-of-a-kind and thrilling Private Tours Experience and have a secluded vacation in Palawan. <br>id: 3<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgkSe818jo1L-BrT1r77lY4gA6OpFMQnxIFrBBnijhP8MUejJbE9WIUSFmLmsrQ_1GJ-VVhUvrHANtrKDQ3QEc5fUt3tT0a314bAVFbCjWo2CjoFev7eH-tEEtAWsMgGoY4c-1jzVW6wRI2m6F3rG94hJvjdLz8gEvrJ59RCFzX9Q5GggobHJI6CXWgVkAM4O20X2mUAr5IK2q8AQYItsdDdb7qeFVgycTsqYE2YONEpEwPsMTJq0f9TP8?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgwK-8b0VKm741shCPRutxLt8ixwyti_eS-HniZRo76omRWIsDYN4kKo9q4rdcU8jcivSOEgNq1kSMigchin9yHiUMF1TBK9CIrUxR2SyfbnnDqZVhFeWtbdOAR-dW0dGLQNo2O04B2YiH-3eFuF2QLv_iQyGM6fgNqaOQoXgEMKrrJRKIZjuRznpoOZRSH3rLRz1kNrDYCSzSWT-j34n5PTdxQOQWyX-01CQPsmwUhc4KrV2QTETkh0cc?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjQkG0GDxCHWfzAZR6yPz4yNPmP7aVvOkqaQqY1V13HCdpm2EJu0qyPAlRDcgSJWHFvPA0T7wKHhzRRVICwgkVnWLJe2z8e789Btfx6S0u9aRUwZhz9oGCZEM-ntY9-uskqFgS0vWFiM9WHsoD_MhnwKXPUf10f0lv2vRE_-zM71cqbi-lDX9x216rziJkZLNnBOmrqaTqESFS4ABezafy3xNXsT254KOdVftCvakiBth0GTj-AI8DdHVI?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhQlcdcp-hfmJ_MCc5qLpaa0u7u2yBp0VB7xSDrP6cVdfIO-VFd_F6vBViAqEXzfemr4PeWjdOnbbQNdwilyM03N7-difDddSP0YjN1kfwqJOM2f25zJLgCCebkFMkTh66i-b2SedGaoWk6Hc3BfcPUK274ey6sPWWG8irc__N-Xhxh_-tiAlEoJzCrw6AxDkh_k9tdMZqDGuWxq2kCi8QawPqQfTKnw9yZ2lyvs_j8gyUTUnzQ6pCdEoc?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZin7JkoRwAJ5cVHh4ii6R1MyWc4zaUBrBCwsDhDjJ7a3g4HEPUOa2sJVD1vJhGaXqDVxiGGZaOroMGQc_ETAZziPbWzeHW-PTl7hEoc6RfOr6jKwcG--g_syEQVizXZozYCCm5BZL1SLcNVMwSpbP9Xy1ACDlQonrASl6OSj6muSLgFA_oNuSLNu2uoLcRNqZtZ0U0LYHUeMgKgvkpcPEGouc6608FApwTxjS1RhAGAiUN1jbYpFTAc2zs?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-FFD600</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Contact No: 0919 595 9869                      Hotel Oasis Port Barton is a 16-room property located in the center of Port Barton. The hotel is a 2-minute walk from Itaytay Beach, 18-minute walking distance from Pamuayan Beach and 1.6 miles away from White Beach.

Hotel Oasis Port Barton provides accommodations with a restaurant, free private parking, a bar, billiard and football table and a shared lounge. Our 3-star hotel also offers room service, free breakfast, free-flowing coffee, a concierge service and free WiFi.
Our bar & restaurant offers Filipino, Thai, International & Swiss dishes and is open to accommodate you from 6am to 10pm.
Countless coconut palms, walks along the beach, and boat trips to the surrounding islands are part of the daily routine here. We also offer our guests one-of-a-kind and thrilling Private Tours Experience and have a secluded vacation in Palawan. ]]></value>
          </Data>
