        <name>Itaytay Inn</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZizcY2VNdIU3zNMA_X16hqB4pTTzlf1Bei6Vcx4TNdzCyjqHUVAhlcxbnp7RfirvEz-1zgqpAI1rgxYo2mbbIFma5fRyi_7d3NXaMAsKLffk6YiR97ZowYd-QeiauDQhOUzyDxsaTPN0muaAH3IBgHm1tMR6ocRTe6_EjVwkG2-npmAtcs9kvn_3U1d6vc4YaZooiJmsoaci5e6vLL8kjCYDaw1aRsR9wNzFQZG4NQcWsKTtKC5otzg2Xc?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0975 125 0675                      ITAYTAY INN features accommodations in San Vicente. With free private parking, the property is a 4-minute walk from Itaytay Beach and 1.3 miles from Pamaoyan Beach. Guests can enjoy mountain views. Free Wifi is accessible to all guests, while certain rooms are fitted with a terrace. At the guest house, every unit comes with a shared bathroom with slippers. A baby safety gate is also available for guests at the guest house. <br>				<br><br>id: 1<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgFfL13O5MxOraRQsfERhikIcqWtfSYZByKHrhW4aeeP25DNoujybFhwMRdjBakbIr6_f-ydJjuyP3eaE5xjAkpzcsIGMEDcaTbjQ5TNi2AgYUWVIBnJiWKj3FmPIFplWzFJdXjwsITQRt_1kUX-DnSt7h7FXX39zib4feAYjFAVgwAiREy-lifZXj-fQspCZrDLVn-gxuePaghZ58FeeITBdWlBk4paZCCZJoJlVaenI_kZQ8UZQt6WuI?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjLPlvuZptGmBIhp3xLDRX9np1CI8Kkgyl-kg0ZbMJYxpeRpMmR2YaxryKEGzkolYnk1dz31Vb0L7kKP7PkktcvCuvubQ7VZVSUIv0HJGxHZ7QKfXq5rZdVETICybK-BVxS89EaBjM8TMNj1pKEXWjQ4fWeZ8r8scOOKEc-3zB_FWnHx9eMWzpcziyrFIZynUmSpIl9rzDQQVJY1aOqE7zKW3mVG7nKkc83WZmALAOVHCysIgG28OA7l1U?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
