      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Jungle Bar. Resto & Cottages - Jungle Bar, private suite & pool]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZindNewzt34cWewPemT2vocpe1qjyGMxKk5_-DjSjiRQWpDEwwhskwmdm40b6pqj-DC6K8IX0IjmDtfCmEO4mSZIzJwRAAunJbVWy-RNHt1nBihNn1qjuAj5H6_nU4qiL_g_x8nHo9sKhIh5ZtHhfj-9YDbzk61l1AT_g3pF-qujzgZywMiBh6TgMgr-cWOrphHO5qad-NVzXO33syqB9yzSs4QzGMatqv1mADkhOK8lNll_llMTvf8jkk?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0919 319 2197                      Jungle Bar Honeymoon suite & private pool in Port Barton offers a 1-star hotel experience with a swimming pool with a view, sun terrace, and lush garden. Guests enjoy free Wi-Fi, a restaurant, and a bar.<br><br> The traditional and romantic restaurant serves French, local, Asian, and international cuisines. Breakfast includes continental, American, full English/Irish, vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options. Brunch, lunch, dinner, and high tea are also available.<br><br>Amenities and Services: The hotel provides private check-in and check-out, a paid shuttle service, concierge, and tour desk. Additional services include a minimarket, housekeeping, room service, barbecue facilities, and luggage storage.<br>id: 3<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjJK1EKDmJI5b61A8XOkJ0UovZFEtmoFHAnInqk638DbgcvAxw3j_pYgtsSeW3DUnOK5MQMCmkkhzPo5uU1MocG2Ij9hWItH9qPGEhH9NhsWi5EUQR9AmDngFXiZZArrZ93vWqWQBfhbAucP2b9N_k48xd2FkOlVX-M8JGc5BCgOQiJE2LOc8iawCze1vd5-oTaNY-mraR5CaCwMaQ-Mz_Pu3aoEGioj3oPUoLD2j-IZLmf2k8hwyy-1EI?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZi60zfSBiU0GpVhogNo8NAgx1d1lS-_bAGCdzjpB0qKXJkRQXY5S0kfXYbqhPoVPM8FYEdAbWxJ6pArF1pjH5nqNnqnU5_Ug69IfdZQqji3DUYU_qtHUF2kH14NrCv7-2SLsxtTJ8TaIKcrOIOV23lJqRjyIJw3IES_jHXPfCt3JlU-ovxlIoYvHb-NOqnkBI7SUUSFnpyMZY85rdg7qZmHF_00HkGx6GqjbOoBiGfSzynEYXJdngmmNXA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjJOZkeyLO64UKqF2BUQD_Pqsy-Cz_SIRgKGScfXX33CZQDzXOC5B25JKIaYkSN0KRwa0IPSArqnaDIMKyHcymdnnPONdwLE0Kg0-98XkBM-9pO09z1YPyy7-PcKBqevNJDv1wbIeW1kEPtfXhaE-vpmXNz_RaBiQVr90nVUAY0-hHLFSHhUETeMztmLw2XfSFj8U8ndhp3eLQWpq-tSTooLmqvm9DxLlpadBGpbd2HLf0CkX4X-wGszUE?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjM0jrxAM7h5-FNlWrRGuPkXnJ2uNUXxhTo_NQUUrn61HmDcHi2VQAjpiqIZB7dJYgJe-Pd-rGV0Ma8xFUtXS52P6zQorT3PNjpGq-tPdoqVI5G8xwaWzW34hzyHvHxdbX0JiI3w1Zr_KEsmK_BzAE0NT6lmoJGX_kd1TbQQDFHpEzkfXk2AE48e4wV40fUYBBW7VASy4r3JkGbw3yORNgYheXpDiV6cLDKilrlbij23mTDxo_3ShekzwQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-FFEA00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Contact No: 0919 319 2197                      Jungle Bar Honeymoon suite & private pool in Port Barton offers a 1-star hotel experience with a swimming pool with a view, sun terrace, and lush garden. Guests enjoy free Wi-Fi, a restaurant, and a bar.

 The traditional and romantic restaurant serves French, local, Asian, and international cuisines. Breakfast includes continental, American, full English/Irish, vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options. Brunch, lunch, dinner, and high tea are also available.

Amenities and Services: The hotel provides private check-in and check-out, a paid shuttle service, concierge, and tour desk. Additional services include a minimarket, housekeeping, room service, barbecue facilities, and luggage storage.]]></value>
          </Data>
