        <name><![CDATA[Lunazul Guesthouse_Restaurant, Coworking Space & Gym]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhI4Gd8sm3gI9FySZDqe7j9T_OrqlCb_YnMGuxjWTA1cU1ssa38kSHVT8428IOw9wIUgyy5wq3aOr3CgQ8IMlKSvGoOJ2QrklBdLtadNi5vRQiJISEuPkHnmLFG6pXpWWvyxF_HCYKeFCelTiOClY4YVDToTu7-O2KXbNtqneyK_PcMUoU9v73c6S364sGVq-EZfmUFIilUZHRxCmNeu6PkOHDP4CzwdsRUPiVwoVWNPwZgDjjlD6kIP8U?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0915 356 1070/0935 548 8601                                                              Guests can enjoy a terrace, restaurant, and bar, complemented by free Wi-Fi. The restaurant serves Spanish and Asian cuisines for brunch, lunch, and dinner, while the bar offers a relaxing atmosphere.      The guesthouse features a fitness room, outdoor seating area, and yoga classes. Additional services include a paid shuttle, hairdresser, luggage storage, and free parking.<br>id: 3<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhGsZ6lCPDAmQm6WpDDkLEugDFocWJLuuH6ZsjW2nBe7wfzl2DjdqlerJS58-KvZ0kQnh2jhdogi1yCk38rsPNYlJEa7GLJOmPUV_y-u3SXeGGQqx05cx6O8fylTX5JJ_CuGAX3JClTO5tpfHVwrpDRFe4kQcYpmCBBnpblcNqH6UTZgfcePK6_Hc59AJYhJsN9v4ZajUvrwmUGlUEa4UMEqrXZxm1TWUVj0z8h3lp95q0adBl-vcXwOIY?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgwUaDa7sr_0Ux2omGXbYt41b16y7g4UTGWs6exyV_lEEqx0WU3UPS3NFuyGWc-qsr1jmq5bD05sq4LqFO5DsrJvDOM3HBLy2c0A3p7uB_9xso1Pxp6KdCck4uqv0yVGdqQKRZ1wQufg0jCpWsgjyOij8asM1nBLuhEOlY64_tL0Au1S_OTXtBy5wOXDd-_nvc4_T0_Yh0tOPxaoUbAW3PmmdKyLj_Q74xwITJauU4c5mCjU7ajwxcAFsY?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjqcqxyItVhgqEpbTYrgy4Abrq7I3bfheBD458pbeu1z0J-fpHtBJcf0aU_qJyxo21XfF1Sks5m9rxAs_O7U42o5yZQnrvQRZVKD5i_oXj9YciiMg12LMNeca6Kv4NyHPrYJ0xoePDgQzFdwGCUK8AGRw0mHw0mBnyoAv7bjAdWduKdGBMrsutFxxncmduo6YIfr2bJF3eSAt1sPbR_MVmdTmwzDd9fOp5v9OW77ceTWSjif2j8AKCaVo