          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0915 356 1070/0935 548 8601                                                              Guests can enjoy a terrace, restaurant, and bar, complemented by free Wi-Fi. The restaurant serves Spanish and Asian cuisines for brunch, lunch, and dinner, while the bar offers a relaxing atmosphere.      The guesthouse features a fitness room, outdoor seating area, and yoga classes. Additional services include a paid shuttle, hairdresser, luggage storage, and free parking.</value>
