        <name>Luzville Transient House</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZi301iSNO1iIVwVOZx4No1BUzuk1gj5302m2eYfHyxCkCHaEof0gHB83W3_x_ZK09Cen7SX-mg-kLEMp5MCuEn-_k0J2qrRpfMoq5aa1V0W5M1Q9Zg6AjEA26HgY7nKOPM-tZig5Do8PwmfM5KdNYjm9nF0E8kzGQvnafmf28AkdLeKhxUwS86Ion8JC0wU0A3Mhnic7D98vm_zDUUxJcvEiGuzSDCYI0LEW9lHpiOBiTP1-_YuJ5Wv3-g?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0953 255 4290                      Luzville Transient House in Port Barton offers a lodge with a garden and terrace. Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the property.<br><br> Guests enjoy air-conditioning, kitchenettes, balconies, and private bathrooms. Additional facilities include a minimarket, outdoor seating, picnic area, and bicycle parking.<br>                                                                      A continental breakfast with warm dishes, juice, pancakes, and fruits is served in-room.<br>id: 1<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgQx0s10K8fmBl2cbfDz0vjapsubLRfEFIcbiwNHs2jOw6f3Cy97snJykA-COFxbEaPXdurgcZgO5l_vPomzC8HIyggNTJl7HHc99yyetL1yYWUR2vawRERO1OEc3u9t32KMKoDr9weOjte7KpL0e7C-966DxHVhKil09SSf9_eYTcHCzHUimUebHi7VmGm82WZgwaN3bAZXBeAia6vyFtq66ONEaQXCqgG--iyF4AbWkdH7g3g3fn9sag?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZj85HRtRLlfoiOSw44OLOakpRB3tq7zT6uakA7IoN3p_TjfK68rJGpVOxR6Gq-BCPbHjBqwAlqMulgn4IxWbwgPAublU22ZqP9cMVJUQRPZpKCyisL0awHC61FzYWvPwO5kYu_kzHaTTWM_vUsK5mWaRjb5n96Vj6XHIVcUqeGxlOyu9h6gpnGZeBhapRJ6H1kKzzsAlnS6NK1m8_jcXRtu6VZAyV1C1YBPCRP9fZlGsinETXDzKbC9zaQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-C2185B</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0953 255 4290                      Luzville Transient House in Port Barton offers a lodge with a garden and terrace. Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the property.

 Guests enjoy air-conditioning, kitchenettes, balconies, and private bathrooms. Additional facilities include a minimarket, outdoor seating, picnic area, and bicycle parking.
                                                                      A continental breakfast with warm dishes, juice, pancakes, and fruits is served in-room.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="id">
            <value>1</value>
