        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgGNFBVEuLuahHJTQEmmdrffKNMlv7lgt5zpRME38VkL4Kv4K9sK1RMhATmfQuHLO_g5rdepEk3Mvt9weBVaQVDzj6cI2odrC6V4aLbE8gQuQ04XRb_ckLFpHU541DHbwGwSY-3vOnZJA2C34lOdHzQUWRQ0IXizY9wBfJV2zLvMly8NiH3SgG-ByZAwp3ie-vNlLx5moNordDNBr49LEWGSKFegqS0ZUKVk5_sUnDMvr2x0FhEw4JXJp4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0939 147 7614                      Malaika Resort in Port Barton Town offers a lush garden and a spacious terrace. Guests can relax in the outdoor dining area or enjoy the bar, perfect for unwinding.<br><br>The resort features balconies with stunning views, private bathrooms, and free Wi-Fi throughout. Each unit includes a dining table, outdoor furniture, and a barbecue area, ensuring a comfortable stay.<br><br> A variety of breakfast options are available, including continental, à la carte, full English/Irish, and vegetarian. Guests can savour juice, pancakes, cheese, and fruits each morning.<br><br>id: 3<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZicf1RncbqlOw00LLBWpjHp_IRFNmt9y4nhGFEkl5-zstR3Sm6s2SZLJwR_7wrdVG3vrKVbVixy4MTzaojhA7syG3uKw3LMa5weZ93g-WoDBHFK5VcNqcyt6ruwK7ffhU71ZtDxZincm5LFDJ5tIC-lztGQgQb18coXB3GUV0QwjY1M7OLwVox9WKvv5VMXdNUUNIs1vL6ScsIEeHWqY7qy0c__O9fAZXRRViD12EYiCCQOmD4wFqmVovo?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZihmkOXLtUm5ejmQfsQQpDQ3UMc_l5N59MZE9RBHH7stp4xtNn_4kXS4RM6M0W9H9uBedGKw_8lipOOnqzTLhFVg0d18C95gDIH3cNsRqKU1PIpl6OccaizVlakFyOGkUDiRHxRjy2TseH8OWPfi40NE5LhYK7p_NC6W7nppjlOl4bwmVnVM0oAmEWbIYjCb5KoCvCnugdArv_hI8KWDE09S3iNa90rA5VP06pFx3dS8OyrF5I1-vI6OO4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhdCAQvV6jkZLosQqcM_9UmY9WvaVS3bRhozVeDTsru861CFv0P-x-LW_SJ9sOMDLm9t_6UizqYEBNtC_T0HomT-dKwlPnnQ98R9SWwzQGQYk0QiRUlxofAaxWom1ucZR0qEfSgoW1_MgL1XLzuc20DaQrAst7MISXJLXvxf-DyfSHa2F7Jpl16hLowaK9pfV-Qrih2cH-9xzeWfl36OXZhxOFZcC8KiJSaSbI9blXNbzLs7LVjkEV8l2Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-FFEA00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0939 147 7614                      Malaika Resort in Port Barton Town offers a lush garden and a spacious terrace. Guests can relax in the outdoor dining area or enjoy the bar, perfect for unwinding.

The resort features balconies with stunning views, private bathrooms, and free Wi-Fi throughout. Each unit includes a dining table, outdoor furniture, and a barbecue area, ensuring a comfortable stay.

 A variety of breakfast options are available, including continental, à la carte, full English/Irish, and vegetarian. Guests can savour juice, pancakes, cheese, and fruits each morning.
</value>
