m/*/3ABkJAZiQnexVR4JjWyqJ9G69V6LRwKAcMbuq-OrqI8KupOJSziUoSSn9QHjZyrQniXTM7VNUx2A5olTFdTmW_mrglShAw3KAL3pMCoeHZKL9e6Az_ljWNuQo0X7Osyfpiw4RbqQqrZT7Ys3lqquYSeglu02B3cE_hqTffva_-gySpfqW87EGarr_YZ_C7D6v3WJ5BBinu3KQyzoFUAMHUzaX12KSa9njEe-e0YOWP5mMvzMgbocHumTYuoeci_s?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-C2185B</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>My Green Hostel in Port Barton offers air-conditioned rooms with private or shared bathrooms. Each room includes a sofa bed, mountain views, and a bidet.

 Guests enjoy a sun terrace, bar, and free Wi-Fi throughout the property. Additional amenities include an outdoor seating area, full-day security, bicycle parking, tour desk, and luggage storage.</value>
          </Data>
