      <Placemark>
        <name>Nitevo Reggae Bar and Restaurant</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjgWQ636MkxIV4jp2fQjpsJb1rVrrl_Lxdrzb54gAIhoq-MEJV9SYCzPl--SuGv8PW49t0vU-t245aygIR1ZJ5GNWw4o6W65S9ZuwmW1XnSoHFZaJ3Jo0uhMItOFePEyW4aqIjT-yW92mrDJFFXsIRXVIn_7EeITl77Tk3kVGiL3l7T4kL39M4npYTjj00NQydSacz4P_mlT7Vo6-mJPFbUos30isbnYp97X09EQxRkVzbfQR6vTWNfvA4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0949 151 4394                      Nestled right on the beach, Nitevo Reggae Bar and Restaurant offers an incredible atmosphere that perfectly captures the essence of island life. With its vibrant vibe, this spot is a haven for music lovers, featuring fantastic live performances that keep the energy high. The friendly staff adds to the welcoming ambiance, ensuring every guest feels at home. Whether you're enjoying refreshing drinks or savoring delicious food—there's something for everyone, including vegan options!<br>id: <br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjUgdn0_4W2-BHF0XID00gBMIhQex6nZYIH7BRETG2tkiuSsNkoAhJWSwoiSY-XJPcKL_lmnewEc8UIBpFGSjS_NxFjo-iy6JMN31S4o7spE9r3K6UCdALjsxDfiM_qOnLQNF79BmoXUJ-hTDdq7eXD5xMJFvocZijAKP6X-BPhcdCVZIzorN_qIGxYqWRWWWCzxJgK0x3NswzBKR1amDmPOpN3PI8QV_wh0OAiC7SXLnUathfVZkAlvlg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1577-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Contact No: 0949 151 4394                      Nestled right on the beach, Nitevo Reggae Bar and Restaurant offers an incredible atmosphere that perfectly captures the essence of island life. With its vibrant vibe, this spot is a haven for music lovers, featuring fantastic live performances that keep the energy high. The friendly staff adds to the welcoming ambiance, ensuring every guest feels at home. Whether you're enjoying refreshing drinks or savoring delicious food—there's something for everyone, including vegan options!]]></value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="id">
            <value/>
