        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-C2185B</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0995 619 1965                      Ocean Mist Tourist Inn in Port Barton offers direct access to a private beach area and beachfront. Guests can relax on the terrace or in the garden, enjoying stunning sea views.

 The guest house features family rooms with private bathrooms, air-conditioning, and tiled floors. Each room includes a bath, bidet, free toiletries, and a shower, ensuring a comfortable stay.

 A bar provides a relaxing spot for guests to unwind. Free on-site private parking is available, and the property is pet friendly.</value>
          </Data>
