        <name><![CDATA[Prince John Lodging & Restaurant]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgSIdiYYaXs6p1e33z7RqT6ELnDpZBcvy-U0Be6ML1cP4ULpeUtSNxs90lS3lJKGE1i24pB4ZnMmeRRIroi1OMpb6_oYVHvomGYQIi3508tBSnd3e8y5nYUMAxPyoJKe4ZBi_o9UXVg1I7QXCZptOUs9mgLTrUW1BRJz6Mwq59pWcmPuEEKdyJps6SeYR0iAG0nFnCK5QjOkW2r-R7FvFzWZyFzo0TTNJX6Vo4fn5C4_EWvxh-8Jw4HyFc?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0995 965 5271                      Offering a barbecue and views of the sea, Prince John beachfront cottages and Restaurant is located in Port Barton. There is a restaurant and guests can have fun at the water park. Free WiFi is featured and free private parking is available on site.<br><br>All rooms have en suite bathroom with shower facilities. Some rooms feature a minibar and a clothes rack.<br><br>Prince John beachfront cottages and Restaurant also includes a sun terrace. Guests can enjoy a meal at the on-site restaurant or a drink at the bar.<br>id: 3<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjuVF8VTc96_qVewhHFftxW4QmSQkrf93W-2Au7IKZ3fxJSh6W9vlGxT6Kawc0nQAsH1Wu7fM1GnPEgAEnRzoomKn7FvhtP0UDpj5cVnmmN6lJjCrJZSuncSGva4dOsHQ2wG6Wp57J4Cu_n7opvIk5M268cB3argajzHFCN8pKRuNR2D-eBYGCCpNYuPn2ogDdniRin-Z7nDzmqx7yCO517dfWWOdZ6L3j-JeWp4UzAqURkpMd1dElSOPE?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZg2uPkPYM3NcHg0GDjQLFXHSYgYsE5zb9JFC7vsJgdL4_7knVh38H1dJejFxiFQ0dJGt4GtBR0EFjhqfwBGHoVTrzGvEAFi1StE9iSZu3YkFBVWpVVXfg1VnL5__qzncpkx9hl2bdzVQk-tb-1jIi_PplhPP94Rt3m2ZBO-SmtkUMIOs-iYBgaHWlDEle1b2TnoBtHkxayZdn_lyX-9vLoTQj-PrG5NBJV1uqvTj61zPwE7G9m-CfplO7c?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgaBFWn2tOLGpITm2Fo4yQlLeZrVakyMLliAMYQBBfjAwMp_AspBizWSZSbBMdOX-L4y9FuJCwXIHoRQ8hMdr8RqJ3IqgpAtMX6Q6w-7xw_KvIqNuWiMRpmyz-ka7jb7pexlT9TPpwBxR6P3HR2aJvIjHjE3R7EUfx