        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-FFEA00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0995 965 5271                      Offering a barbecue and views of the sea, Prince John beachfront cottages and Restaurant is located in Port Barton. There is a restaurant and guests can have fun at the water park. Free WiFi is featured and free private parking is available on site.

All rooms have en suite bathroom with shower facilities. Some rooms feature a minibar and a clothes rack.

Prince John beachfront cottages and Restaurant also includes a sun terrace. Guests can enjoy a meal at the on-site restaurant or a drink at the bar.</value>
          </Data>
