          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0917 178 1555                      Pisces Tourist Inn offers air-conditioned rooms with private bathrooms. Each room includes a garden view, kitchenware, and free toiletries.

Guests enjoy a garden and free Wi-Fi throughout the property. Additional amenities include a coffee shop, outdoor seating area, and barbecue facilities.
                                                                  The inn provides private check-in and check-out, a paid shuttle service, shared kitchen, housekeeping, room service, and a tour desk. Free on-site parking is available.</value>
