        <name>Royal Suites Port Barton</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgTNOKwqf-FAOuwiMsZdvGuivFAhJheutXW-XobFSCKiSPt54o4w_zQ29zJ_GLZtDDdQ6ItfZpN6ML-9OoyoAZDUyj1HCXT_7gsw95JcHKZYITHkXl6tGduv89xAtKLSV947sHaCBiMmvCNd1knl1K-tgkF3fgf9oWG-zeZBre7K9j0V_Zyky8qb2HPOOIJyi54eN52NIFhSPQDvmrKGMa1bSIVoVnFenUks8KzHmFjZRvNtXRfVtp8X_k?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0995 356 1674                      ROYAL SUITES - PORT BARTON in San Vicente offers a spa and wellness centre, swimming pool with a view, sun terrace, and lush garden. Guests enjoy free Wi-Fi throughout the property, ensuring connectivity and relaxation.<br><br> Rooms feature air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and garden or mountain views. Additional amenities include balconies, kitchenettes, and interconnected rooms, catering to diverse needs.<br><br>The family-friendly restaurant serves Italian cuisine in a traditional, modern, or romantic ambience. Breakfast options include continental, American, and Asian, with local specialties and fresh pastries.<br>id: 3<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiw7R5b5Nu7csqHbTuedLRxqu2RwQc_gx5AZBndyMymRWOzO3s5HI54imj7tS0MOVDHrnFKvMQ5MPKjtjl8Qlny0-kXvvuYmvi-JRCVq121VPjr0JAVANi2TcboeGf4BWK6nlz6TvPgv7yHYYPHIq7H3p8NhvbrzApAstL-YnIsiBCNrjGDAQnVXRAKpdo6C72R3suiHuaZAbj-LrRRDmEkzImON-Ta-FUECaGO03sOkDqCx0ABBSzPFtg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjaG9MNzrP1s-D4cBF1s7gvAOgQ_DmGED3R3DPxvPedh68dmdgCOeh3Q6mfWo36W8CVfPTyCHlUb6b9lZShDuiPiJe75Ic31uwqZfxVgnooZTitsZUmbGjcvx2NblIY6hPhcrUFduRYjBhOuusmMng5EoHwSwJK9DUFqbKibulso2V-31VKy6SCOsbGTPRsuGKCjN_oXHFNm81hB78PRqQMk5_KzTHQn2xm2A8u7zDMT5B5UiTeEB8whLM?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhf2T_THBIgsH_w3Ri_GWjWb0VN-uM6g4iYqGsuWK_cZK2w1l0orf