          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0995 356 1674                      ROYAL SUITES - PORT BARTON in San Vicente offers a spa and wellness centre, swimming pool with a view, sun terrace, and lush garden. Guests enjoy free Wi-Fi throughout the property, ensuring connectivity and relaxation.

 Rooms feature air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and garden or mountain views. Additional amenities include balconies, kitchenettes, and interconnected rooms, catering to diverse needs.

The family-friendly restaurant serves Italian cuisine in a traditional, modern, or romantic ambience. Breakfast options include continental, American, and Asian, with local specialties and fresh pastries.</value>
