        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhYd_xd12OZC8rJLybqCwY0HXgcPvKm-rBqKjEoivA6ezd2wCMR1tEn-5dyCp0TODqq9SOevwe3QYMOKQkBE4gvu4j_kpi1Zc0_rBrw5q0pgJ4oDXr_2lt3-Ye1YjVKit5xKfoag_5f5C4DyimhV5iE0leRW0TnfiLZSt_jHDdStcvXy8osmMsFx550XOoMv4uESstRZ0uMsnYdWPpLwDhEb39la4P9ttbUaSraKE-BUHwdtxTKYZO_Izk?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0929 887 8824                      Rocel’s Beach Barn Resto-Bar in Port Barton, San Vicente, Palawan is a laid-back beachfront spot serving tasty local and international dishes, refreshing drinks, and cocktails. With its relaxed island vibe and sea views, it’s a great place to unwind, enjoy sunsets, and hang out with friends.<br>id: <br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgRpdI25SyZNcoFLeEvDExxzs81di9e0_uaerMHBPpLZpjXAZutjwBexAaHgZnyokrzIGNFPPoDgKg5MqPcqHqc7pkwpLA_e3cu3em6A3iZbx5vQPGBuN5X0KV5d2C18lqEy2VsYqbsH2cUCoTuB5ID0dQV8CVZv_U1b89b3jIa4f-26R4OSjdXUCDj5HzSruUoB8aVXlWhZVqGKrwZlQR5tLxnGWjJV0hBnXk36GRbLyybFMPqxBlJbAM?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiIaZyA2YePVswCHisVa5Wd7XYbas25TuE4461nPvZ-FY3dIJYvz-xJfkUUw3GCcoFhhMUcKrUhXkrm2cS1aCjc7-Zy9e0QghUgwjKcfUKDWJonNnks1TSvvih3Y4YprZ_LyU9jJBTzTyltvvZoYcl3LgEiiEakVt6B2keDHRPao00lOf0NphL2TZnyeRSjolFN1KzVXZQSua5q0ER_sCJtbv3avQe8s4rG8ZarH4mMtN_Xf_vffN6QTsY?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgYN9t4n2ORVFaAIErNhpCar2cwCOS7xYKt8AafCEygQi-_W9IgjJTmZgNR5BHGTqGcjzAEEiV5Qt3Js3tRwRnn8dxN-V5jFxSHmnuzgtU-AG7fND-9A241YrKKcdx1P-SXk6Rta9BgfcylIasqXc-aTWfN41G87hOwZlLMVRL5vb5z8US0hvfx9GJRIonECjSkYfbNBzWiB5sKHVEJ46C19332dpw84AQJ3HaQfU18h0PzA7pltVOVktk?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
