      <Placemark>
        <name>Santa Claus Hilltop Pension House</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhGOJuc87KAdPGEgbZHCO_JeOQUaLpNRJIVRi7H_3IhzP0SGcRt99oQoB5hdC78tX0lZp2bnPhTUMTGyU-tglUIdoYjfMYz9YhpWahhRmr-PRqljZN7A0wyBUyTeIjuXJaUPII4zUMpQzi5DZAP9QyTk1ZmLmY3hzDyNeCrTgI0QPhU4C-_zM3vH1qxalgtD-NRs4RusZRIwwK-fxXnKjjUogL-AvoRTXswstRbUt0tCD4w0AVplhXl2D0?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0926 708 0282                      Santa Claus Hilltop in San Vicente offers family rooms with air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and garden or mountain views. Each room includes a balcony, terrace, or patio, ensuring a comfortable stay.<br><br>Guests can unwind in the garden or on the terrace, enjoy the outdoor furniture, and take in the scenic views. The property features a dining area with a dining table and outdoor seating, perfect for relaxation.<br><br>A continental breakfast is served in-room, including pancakes and fresh fruits. The breakfast is highly praised by guests, enhancing their morning experience.<br><br> The bed and breakfast provide a paid shuttle service, housekeeping, room service, and car hire. Additional amenities include a work desk, free toiletries, and a seating area, catering to all guest needs.<br>id: 1<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjk19lckyf9Vg-Ja3T7e33Mn3rhzLuVBbxrAX3ScYVpERYQRmCW4w2kOOumXcppHwt86e4bih70f-dfdXlwBm4euG11oFqmh15TWJx1PotaoPL4G2484-wUdav4UkESuWw3Zv6FzT0rS5w4_BDKio6Hi88knWVuKvWZmBvcHYww9tNHqDE9w1ozgeUy7618NOmFXc-KmPKyJCrm-S6UYizeShgf78JwkjHoRdtOsfYAwwB0ECt4gUSCR0w?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhPbNUJQBO5u1EgL1q_6-BuWoJwaq1WJAheQXXrVo8_tqkpqNbbhuIJd_YER_SAA2FikACAmiK2j3d96Ku-NsE4jaAXKyb_rYBGARL94EztRE7S4BSeHsmXetq4At_4XsJnabFkgLSsF-eXYPkVwPknQ9LodYXP-SIwWEwFlxnnsN7qaW-EpiinmaB1I6K2af3LjWbew5GVGLodzYauI-IjM2JmLak8TpRJiuodg5PhnEVYEwbRReUpwyY?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhWO8w7KDCIKTib4TqJJKdCl9-xgx4SygqGpamiF8Q_Xc5AL1I-CvcDRel6nD-P0rwBhZFhT8nesPwGsffZ7NJWIsFf1-5P16bWOo1MF53Co1QtfbsOXnrh4j9Ww8ByLeiB_n7WPBkhpdfaUxTIfDLMku64ONI8EQE-NbGjSYEyuEMIbYpHy3k7CEH3XI0tgQtQajDuOJN6utSgT6vg8sM0ZA5knwesp8QuTu0BorS6Y08qDNa_7h1xRt8?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhdjqNWgsFirNqQ8xzlMJVZSnfznhtAge9KMxVXuD42AF5qLa9e2YWYT1fy-0E3riurUqByIV9Qhcbckerl68S9qqQXTYbDjeKbu9StT4ZJKqzdbwlRszbaxMgLalJaSWrbHuf0fGeE5QPiUzV79L7kExtcSIXkXW5M0p5VY1DWfvqzVKsB89K2547iR8UbMnBGBjbkmUb4wKvDB6roDNedM4hpoCfN8v1FNZUfOSIfHnL1flpXR_AmXSc?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-C2185B</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0926 708 0282                      Santa Claus Hilltop in San Vicente offers family rooms with air-conditioning, private bathrooms, and garden or mountain views. Each room includes a balcony, terrace, or patio, ensuring a comfortable stay.

Guests can unwind in the garden or on the terrace, enjoy the outdoor furniture, and take in the scenic views. The property features a dining area with a dining table and outdoor seating, perfect for relaxation.

A continental breakfast is served in-room, including pancakes and fresh fruits. The breakfast is highly praised by guests, enhancing their morning experience.

 The bed and breakfast provide a paid shuttle service, housekeeping, room service, and car hire. Additional amenities include a work desk, free toiletries, and a seating area, catering to all guest needs.</value>
          </Data>
          <Data name="id">
            <value>1</value>
          </Data>
