        <name><![CDATA[Summer Homes Beach Resort & Cottages]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZggogXIdbRmjPQ5VjsYO0WKTOws5sdKfaNBjyTFq8FWSX2i8YWXK6FcvBuCKlsrsyO4ThVFr1Ps0Dl5-ytNKOBDz9CLPXHSMFyHyOaEl7zhu1_9Ac2CPErorQaOmXS6wGbPYsCLU0W7Mui4CQ0POZ2gUf2yhyPzxSj5NNKpeflTF0qLTh42H5Ge4IBcOtTVNTsMrnWa3xhgSVolzgWNGZ8C4qg9hU886-rJlGl78Tdrd_j9UCWNISYhsWU?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0929 887 8824                      Summer Homes Beach Resort and Cottages Palawan in Port Barton offers family rooms with private bathrooms, balconies, and sea views. Each room includes air-conditioning, a work desk, and free toiletries.<br><br> Guests enjoy spa facilities, a lush garden, terrace, and restaurant. The resort features a bar, private check-in and check-out, concierge service, and free on-site parking.<br>                                                                     The family-friendly restaurant serves American, local, Asian, and international cuisines. Breakfast options include continental, buffet, à la carte, vegetarian, and Asian.<br>id: 3<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhw5P_-MbPl7NwRf5jJTrSqO1rwZThtw50BsmUHHTYJA4d5TxSn8-Qi0NXkAKeWJu_QM2ycfvRd7lXio0E88Z1GOKYpKAfQSTKetR_7NBlDM9WpOvnSvcd6vx315zJBsz5HDejDVNXlmhROkw4PKAcZAfuPTYY9L_oowi2R5YYv6qXs-otFKMQXvFhKp68HDK2ImidqYSdJXYiZMWqbXRPoPxe81Dbng52tk_djJtcgVd1YIs9BWOjBfLk?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZh-wIMmbLZ0TwYigcXQU7gPRzg-51I0m2jLDI0SK0uUpcMRPy7CqZd9aVpcHU2T29XuK6DATQAYzeCRDWAy6pAQy-8K7iPEwbw1HEy7G2y_6i1bSEAh3Yp68MFp6O5p8MIrB7kAiZ4BRJhdN9p6MUP7u3g1w7EgVSFS8MimrQV56ws9ZH9AVAvo68ksI8oI0Ryya1_Rmeu79_jDilaQaPjRthP_RqNAsDfUOmmSz6x7eJxsFrQKS2wqfac?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiclJzkSrYI83RnmpnZIS4G4OmHwYdhlQSSihZgDzzagGfzVUQq_A