        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-FFEA00</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0929 887 8824                      Summer Homes Beach Resort and Cottages Palawan in Port Barton offers family rooms with private bathrooms, balconies, and sea views. Each room includes air-conditioning, a work desk, and free toiletries.

 Guests enjoy spa facilities, a lush garden, terrace, and restaurant. The resort features a bar, private check-in and check-out, concierge service, and free on-site parking.
                                                                     The family-friendly restaurant serves American, local, Asian, and international cuisines. Breakfast options include continental, buffet, à la carte, vegetarian, and Asian.</value>
