          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0977 276 5209/0997 276 5209                                                              Comfortable Accommodations:
 Villa Evergreen Restaurant and Rooms in San Vicente offers a garden, terrace, and restaurant. Free WiFi is available throughout the inn.
Modern Amenities:
 Each room includes air-conditioning, a balcony, and a private bathroom with a bidet. Additional features include a washing machine, dining table, and outdoor furniture.
Convenient Location:
 Located 46 mi from San Vicente Airport, the inn is steps from Port Barton Beach and 1.1 mi from Pamuayan Beach. Guests appreciate the convenient location and attentive staff.
</value>
