            <value>Contact No: 0906 077 9365                      Yumi Villas in San Vicente offers a villa with two bedrooms and two bathrooms. The property features a sun terrace, garden, indoor swimming pool, and free Wi-Fi.

 Guests enjoy air-conditioning, a fully equipped kitchenette, private bathrooms, and garden views. Additional amenities include a minibar, TV, and free toiletries.

 Highly rated for its swimming pool, attentive staff, and delicious breakfast. Free on-site private parking and a tour desk are available.</value>
