      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[Ziah's Guest House]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjUQJcaMkY1z4uKavPvflDEgiuvTFNQ9nQqpUuklqQywpn47XY5An997LxnHKltZMybdWn9Zt9esJ-mp96biYfbwfRXn_srlHNSnmx2jnGQcbTz_GzEQvyYLSNnLslx5wO0FFPZhjzXIUG4gfLpi1nlBodqPQtjKn-iyLPeBljdBLCVSD0eO0zEXnPY-MMusK4tkgcNtfXytJUWzbsGE9Yil9BlXhjWoG01i0x7U-XlfPPv85C67BmOyuY?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0915 788 6356                      A cozy and budget-friendly place to stay just minutes from the beach. Ziah’s Guest House offers clean and comfortable rooms with air-conditioning, free WiFi, and private or shared bathrooms. Guests can enjoy free coffee and water refills, airport shuttle service, laundry, motorbike rentals, and help with arranging tours. With a garden, terrace, and friendly staff, it's a relaxing spot close to Port Barton's island hopping, waterfalls and local attractions.<br>id: <br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgwXSRVRg2quOT9vyAxJOh14AiooupG75Xp2z6VoindGHoibCNsKd-9EnRzKeF4tqxhkFAOcvrjmFDvVblkjagJBNdnDXGsCbssektJLUgiBp_VnzY7zGKZZ36Nqzkwk3HPBu7s6-mjeUKRvBA42Dc2C-jRhTUFDW1-tXwUHgBrYJwg0H7hO9c57IDlosZNoBORI1VqXNfiHZ-t4f3VLR2S5vwo2riiOrWIl3VGQ7L6VfIzGIHW8jpew5A?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiWx9fgaln5_oxbwi5Zt1mnykUETKlDkGF1LC284zxdWz-o8aN-8j7hFlKyIKQbvFactuFuNA1iEOXaZlcYyRjtWKRQ7VKkfz2fWwt2d_w8uc_6t1wDszdQIZ4C5AiGND3jN6IQN_jJGvCsQ-MolRh4_SQYL7dFCK3bkp6aJs9O-5Np-ozJKBfBgEpk6RCqRJcDyWd2KKvKTI8OzREE2ZbzAT91IVwbdvPhqj_AgdnvKB6dydDcyYxOsVo?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhA26dAJigpHUVXgr_zaFmjrYFT0At0QaRFOeo5_DHAIsi_a9S6-6-ziRXHkQKo0Jp518IO5rynlU0-L1xup_jQGJQ5raKOJVmJfVdAynpRt0raN13JAN8_U5CNKBFdZMx1S3dWVobYLG-Kj4dMSyv6hdjJ0vdzVRCTEab04hVxTH1nocAuJB7CQsgEC1BQwAufctrdfmAZeZv3t45xaG5Lwlou7S