        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-C2185B</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value><![CDATA[Contact No: 0915 788 6356                      A cozy and budget-friendly place to stay just minutes from the beach. Ziah’s Guest House offers clean and comfortable rooms with air-conditioning, free WiFi, and private or shared bathrooms. Guests can enjoy free coffee and water refills, airport shuttle service, laundry, motorbike rentals, and help with arranging tours. With a garden, terrace, and friendly staff, it's a relaxing spot close to Port Barton's island hopping, waterfalls and local attractions.]]></value>
          </Data>
