        <name>Victor Delia  Hostel</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjffgZH_DXA_WziGqZoHIsLotmitOwThHErafh2AanY5uQ8NAC92e56rn9gNpG-v-nfpNWFJG6CnK_x7uak7P6rG5j2no2bRzpJX5uq3ayaZNIQ-gzyYHZLi5o5sUYg-PSInlgwZrPzPXPV772EWZxlEqoGr5peuRxYd0OwLgoaZeufQz6MxBVrUUrAipw4rjOWxfTttHSbTWpQN3yqYlZ7bAOvBgoQDRvT4i4Fj7Wi1sEJxRafQFaaT9s?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>description: Contact No: 0995 093 5169                      Victordelia Hilltop Hostel in Port Barton offers family rooms with garden and mountain views. Each room includes a private bathroom, air-conditioning, and free Wi-Fi.<br><br> Guests can relax on the sun terrace or in the garden. The property features an open-air bath, bar, and swimming pool. Free parking is available.<br><br> Breakfast is served continental, à la carte, and Asian, including pancakes and fruits. Room service and a dining area enhance the dining experience.<br>id: 1<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZghJWTwac_VVSFHmRWaUBDtLBSopNaDUtBGvWDRQmtE4Seg7SoOcl2ovhXAGF49fFtxvTHkTSFIxyFer7OBRkAfE3FFnMbQsIMTxEL6OUAbFnTn2c9YJNxUlw8qoFAuGRm9X3L-V0oSBf8eyy-_xnNnGho1LVE91JWA456XxCfaQEaQpwjQlohDA9B3G3iL-L49_seKiANynpWLNtuCmcPbVvOqE1oYwB6FjgzoDYCMELWIflZiuDg5_3Y?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjmFDPU622xQQuZfFyvX85qStZoTAJuTdkEFhN4YU0687ODCIJ9w0vRzFhJuNy8rmEvQP0FcB_ZghKI2wVPbMCNnPdZnWvZw1R2wXUvsNm4BhmvVuYgn3kBiGOWqhMNffDSFQXI9pMIp8VRu89ud98sHXHagTaXBPoM_cny5sglT0ZGUc33mm9PZt1k1wiu9C7JbSulp1gWwg-4p2rjSyRiwAAzmZV3p3zuqQHnFH02I2JDkJp8sxlLYzE?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhXq5lAreIW3PTqPWBvwQDweDHQ_WyYwh2eFcKtG4TLRs-d0Uz5-OnyPry58D7SdSm-nuB5-LyCW1uuNRAwSkzuRpresDjaZsDdjGGPJ7PQkvGdh5MKWgOIbD_eySViHIdTjTSsOh-rKSVlturAMgkx0QyXRy3WE3ocVbxQ_HQYRddIWLO1BubM9IJ0kJoAlTZUZA4L6jsM3