        <styleUrl>#icon-1602-C2185B</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="description">
            <value>Contact No: 0995 093 5169                      Victordelia Hilltop Hostel in Port Barton offers family rooms with garden and mountain views. Each room includes a private bathroom, air-conditioning, and free Wi-Fi.

 Guests can relax on the sun terrace or in the garden. The property features an open-air bath, bar, and swimming pool. Free parking is available.

 Breakfast is served continental, à la carte, and Asian, including pancakes and fruits. Room service and a dining area enhance the dining experience.</value>
