      <Placemark>
        <name><![CDATA[April’s Tourist Inn San Vicente – Your Peaceful Palawan Escape

Nestled in the heart of San Vicente, Palawan, April’s Tourist Inn is a charming 3-star retreat built in 2017, offering only 4 well-appointed rooms for an intimate, personalized experience. Just 10 mins. away from Poblacion proper, it’s the perfect base for exploring San Vicente's natural wonders—whether it’s basking at Long Beach, or venturing to Port Barton.


]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhf_kYYDMKXVC200_qcp5zVoPUF_Pa66k_rDvNpVzKXlLKF5I7lp-_jSePT9OQUEUeMhuICI_ol7hgSnBxfbwCiJVhxBrDMdgELmKtT2yu8S0U1dEE56BlHK0o_trTdk8DYkFc205GDLMQxGiOgwnaAJ9trhoxeFKZaX_l_UTXRRGmHUf7hGOV4aJXTsS49vKqCqj1Ss9Lykze9NjNgntCOXe6aokiRqFTP7_BZEZuK-qU_iHrs8fesfo4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Contact No: 0908 869 8688                                      April's Tourist Inn in New Agutaya, San Vicente, Palawan offers comfortable and affordable accomodation in a quiet and relaxing environment, perfect for travelers seeking a convenient place to stay while exploring the beauty of San Vicente.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZh1Gu0kl1c7FRKcOO8Khv4ecj6cpKxab96jdaot63rlh9pW0O4RYegzQAomWLuFO4P_bqMyg3BEO0Yu71jXGQuCYDbMF1VR7U8sU3mivTMAHoW40n5zw3PHc4wuiCOgr4JmEuTjIFtjjLdJ8doU1_Omnko8UdhjL3x-bFW31tzZthNylF9BG77xBypJtQA1YiWOQUmF1Q8U8PzF_Qs-dkQNDh2GJX4V2mLgJqYA5m0-WVB24dWsVevruE8?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhjaxHqBY4fjudc4CJQ9WohfprR-tf46y2pUYDyIcxj8Aiw0YrIRIeQ5WEyn7gR8ivDwk9lHtY-VOS_-BStBdBqEKj2Zj_WydY7lfcoKokkRuUHoLbywtGB0_di9WubB4b-IsjYMB1-pQwLKt5ILCxpNpR-rdHPEetni5eOUr3w0r792Nwf71fZEld7_i0ic5tWSI2RYKghBTwQyk__X2uUHWEDusnis-u-vPneaRj0HJWdoDVSEXi6RrQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
