        <name><![CDATA[Foxy's Beach Resort]]></name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhcqeCgr_jKuRDihFooUkORr-g-fimd_6k0vVgMAX6NQTukQOt_RR2zin9B-FXwAzwZmI8rNKUL3GZDyZ2qvrzofd95Ygl1ze9GMl9SLwqErbV4tRQOPoeW965eXhM1VFz9QnDzfxmgjfCd18Xvx6uot3-ebFOOkw2-HQwQjgYcYsmlgNKMWZ1UgJdGXotZ5FwGfFxgO3fZRrqNKvyh7v_CYBiTeDGsfqHy29B3p2GOTKfiNWHpjdsdaQ8?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Contact No: 0999 733 1787                                      This resort villa features free Wi-Fi in all rooms for easy connection, and car park free of charge. Conveniently situated in the San Vicente part of Palawan, this property puts you close to attractions and interesting dining options. Restaurant, hot tub and fitness center are among the special facilities that will enhance your stay with on-site convenience.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZg-EuXdzcok5VNzbXKUzojygBSuUCAKVoaecYDoRE_mhUMJulA_OTGr0Y0w4Nqj0TsWj8TNsBJpvgKxEirxmNbVOuffuYDwxO_ZHk0AT-NJhQ1AMvL9rC4XxAkW2rwGq500-rUrWoa3AfXT2I_FzN3z1LJgu99OUfA3r-KTCj6KStkzYY7D_qqc-3SkJuoJ2qz6RUUy_brJtwo-cgts3lUUWYu4ilW59riAuPS0nuJBKe9PB3K0F-3ZCwQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgVnKtCXjTfgF7_1kMmvqyrCrZMqqD20vGLs1Cmoz6q-Nj6PkjUCLC98MAnl6zaZL5FSvnvIU6mFAkr3ewD-79DQ0hUMlj29rWbW8JeLFr8xaveHpBBTwaoWxBLancHJKAjZjT9vEi6edB1yN3NBFgR1kwOSRrT9EiBSrvrCTt1AAWqJf8LgWb9yFhQJOaa0Qzipr2414jFk-BQuNv4ykWREIrFV9vS7wqVO5LIyEt5N4k6LTRStG5Oqd4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgH6GSxMmlUq7qRBLzr8tL2sQO7vJBzFzGFZNs-2A0nbBcSJ8ipIj5bQp6WApHamkhYIRaoNmPIC8OlWEAM8ag-0gx9ByK5wEBhl7L4wZSl6gOeTsV9geZ1USmkN5gWrrgVIrQAkTg8mhC3CZoxB6SXU-ZVaQzQcbxnpPPrlzyPfX8_jof5NdYMwMsZRnR5H-0YYEsKc7VZ7vszQr5GItpqCbyZ7TvENSfwhedsCPFXxycbSDwEBtRIKiU?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https