      <Placemark>
        <name>Selim Guesthouse</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgYDGkhKt0DmWD_wnePRvleC5t4hEtaAZr2xiyC95yATCABaOoOQFlwi4DgCmzauhTjHnYlSElNZYOyuI7dtJlJuFaWium3MragfBX47szwdGa5MS9LDudyRhYkBrl8Wyz9qO_igTYOKDId5e0DbkS2GLrdVgWV7jAjXCn0lQ7pbZ55JDXhk5XzQc_hTFPE3xxuBPp94gWpmJ56hBmx_8udjr_GmsF_-TnMYu0ZPqMBgTmoWVwUtpZqaFM?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Contact No: 0936 687 3381                                      Enjoy a peaceful stay in a friendly village, just 10 minutes by tricycle from the main town and the Hundred Steps top-hill attraction. Relax on your balcony with stunning views, sleep soundly in a comfortable wooden bed, and enjoy fresh water, coffee, and laundry service. Small shops and warm local greetings make every moment memorable.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgWwZvdSGdWzSgzbNY0kCBKXHqFzLOOuzzJlODbVEWp5uqNBOa9-lGNlY9L-_9A1f6rU_OB79BZZ7G7PhTwZsAoub5mCzpcB33ySFlR7WxT6xIPHaMdjWYqn7rx4Yc-C9z8hek3GBv86IweZzqLF3rDkvslFGsdMLouYe4guXMR2lUmUskY23nyHhdH7e47JrSnk4RT9VVBOr87VbxPR5UQXU1-gGQ0sC8FRXh1VadCxxfZVRy0UYtCthQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZh4qEsE-xeRFNJVsQs_hGHkR2IG3lP5UqbIScZGqe3qIChwwZp1FLxq4JnQoXUMeoHPa-rT729H5JkD6VERnjE2JlHbvtCb4QGhZ0VxnjNquliZJFjh2It2O2EBTGPL0G21D6QqDRhDTayMITBqgf2dWDh4HXvU0gPjNfkmduwM85BIYp9ibDZ9Dv0H-JHWUGyJV56qO2lnYOQUa2J9vnxeS-Hrq7gntM9_AAFj3es63T3GbJCmi2-Jfpw?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZg54Dyk9OClAOx8YsEZJLFDkxGkvdDseurjsQAiB5ydx61ar14WauM0b7TKHtKTckFUlq8aFv2tnAP7FJVZsc9WkDee10vprPbLEkjzdLb09peSUo_Rn_QdHEPnTO7-G2_qt-QYNP8trz0_QDY19KX_6fA0ImSSFuTEpLQLTzMhA_VpW4A6ou_-qrtJ9IgvNzmISQbjH1GLb85CMTxVOEp7tl9uCJ0NhRivE_H2WVRzq6Ty9gDWTabT6a8?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
