      <Placemark>
        <name>Sunset Beach Resort</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZh89RPgGgEW1nAn9NK6Dw6Q62VFmgSTaXotzr_Wyn1i7TGDTM1zvwwljS7XlDXrgw3XaMnw0wGEQyDgZPiFVRHZf5xYU55yIG8HcdS4yDrVJy8g79ZxMxvPZjgL7T61fF_dXtriqbGF56BXv3UmHZROBJ4e2SPB0NjOFk_5Cb6CcaD_klnodj9h4dnwy6e9z5hYZTIGr7vKqgT8PHd39eKhzxIdzchXhBVlvfnmrBx1N1xom0i7wzCXKzU?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Contact No: 0919 974 3997                                      Sunset Beach Resort, nestled along a serene beachfront with breathtaking sunset views, this resort offers a relaxing escape surrounded by swaying palm trees and crystal-clear waters.<br><br>Enjoy your outdoor swimming pool with comfortable sun loungers, or take a stroll along the pristine sandy beach just steps away from your room. All accommodations are air-conditioned and come with modern amenities to ensure a comfortable stay.<br><br>Stay connected with free WiFi throughout the property, and indulge in delicious local and international cuisine at restaurant and bar.<br>Whether you’re here for a romantic getaway, a family vacation, or just to unwind, Sunset Beach Resort is the place to relax and enjoy paradise.]]></description>
