      <Placemark>
        <name>Hotel Elizabeth Resorts</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZja7vBtqnYiL6vd7TWI3JKNr40azvko508rbiAz_wmnuU8Sg9_FmXDfVV-wzLXRVyVKBgOmEAU4Fn6zIRJHDjs4T2V5pLZvndgHyfT_rUN5c_t7P-G4IE_qIIw3Ry9MHhzIodIPvZLRBHn2Lb5kr7cxc34c6pKFdflHNzlSkx85wC9Mx-k_4gx6KY0Zwr3HvsthH-QvySDy7tFh8sSI-b_Qeh9_5e_jAcO6c_1e6TagUAN9MTxwdUdv8QY?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Contact No: 0905 714 3755                                      The Hotel Elizabeth Resort & Villas – Long Beach, San Vicente, Palawan<br>A modern beachfront retreat just steps from the Philippines' longest white-sand shoreline. The resort offers stylish villas and rooms with sea views, air-conditioning, kitchenettes, and streaming-capable TVs. Guests can enjoy an infinity outdoor pool, private beach area, sun terrace, and lush garden. Perfect for families, couples or friends looking for comfort, relaxation, and adventure by long beach.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjN8yaqNIWbb_0akX9n7-gNWjygjcjjSj0TXMQRjgmm2U_pu4zvy8cCInAraizJZfILE9MhGvyTMDlIhA3tZuLwZrSLacncmPcpMJKb59lXTEBMqhLCkgc2TZkKAhe4ArnkIUA7Bz_ugB78YOULWyrf2lbimMt5V8xGFEhH4Li53hu0_kGkCZpeOkd6AGguJOyiMdMCCdqnK0FwbPteY465tKCgAYog9yiqnsyx9QWSOSe8bbiG8V3hW-w?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiev4E74c39lon7JARGlRmA_vV0plrtHr8VNp2bcixRLtdPa0GkFH6624h5prPS139eYmgPMIi1g-Azur2XiF96PPNUbymwLUvnjIrxfZnbqLOKlQWz3k5uZSWw---G8dXYDbqBhGeF6Zv81s0ASLdrPZkQD8lttE2x6_LlG5SsiYxBofjfjgqeUt6p8z14nbd9GAu2t_ZlLBiQP5q_mUqiuXzXI8bCer9JRtzCSRteREVbgSMBIVSQtDI?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiE74-BTJ_mKrgnOnIOXokXt6QmIUwu6HiiXzs6YysSLA8taWNqof7nNeWaqFyBi5EMyWgLor2aZQUtnsXyzX8Ce9BQss70N5G2xmNtQAQ84X3k4pZvPkRmrV6l5duZ97pXUXtbhAs4hD5_zMvx0-mz26KwA4nVajixQNqiilqF_5CF8WYVD8wAk-FmCvy63DjPp2D-9h-HL8M1E