      <Placemark>
        <name>La Vida Bonita Bed and Breakfast</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhEyR3Icurl1oSa2Cvkf6DXuXcRJB4yUjJUSXLdE-2pUrMGr4EbPgOehb3ee8r2qg6Bmg46MaostYqrP-I9U6MBggvSw2WPci_n3krjf2Q_SrYQgaYcnrJ9c7aIIXbrHQA8jGCBZWSocEfaYFaQqJWwNhTZi-FxCJDnwaUAZ-LnULmJwHsZsIqvfTOpMyjdpdc5T0PgpXFCTq7LdBBoQqGUd3fMMxKfAKgPYMgAByekjO1rgzgdHeiQqbQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Contact No: 0920 954 1230                                      La Vida Bonita Bed & Breakfast – San Vicente, Palawan<br>A peaceful retreat just a 3-minute walk from Long Beach, offering cozy air-conditioned rooms with private bathrooms, free Wi-Fi, and flat-screen TVs. Relax in their saltwater pool, enjoy meals at the on-site restaurant and pool bar, stay active with the fitness center, or let them handle your airport transfers and tour bookings. Free parking, family-friendly and pet-friendly too.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZj5rO3k4wgR_ixatRIIi6mKTPz5L10J27YxogGc5plJUOZmGlQlNPjiif_pK0s5QzdbEBwag4IiuD0oXxUh4SNakrr9xQ4wqQGCoEfebqByJm_o7Rsq-JeiYy5hHZMNRnwiLUWhgimV4nJDxCK_c7l9fWRmhrs1i0QjiZ9NlMSDiQk3zJPZZZzRrDnZzWt9IH4eZpPabZbmZLLHf-xM60ZsVqULKBTQgp8AUeEMi452WZd1eCs4pKTtjMY?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhwh7lW7nDhWNBN1Cu4v4UWG034fKjBiciAnBIYrYS1ktMp_RdM7jfsFoTt-4R3hxnllE4QwdKR0fzjes6EcjyEhIKWIQomk9GtyNLE-cLnlDGQ8zXLai3IqLCQBFGzugpzk1yHbxlssM35katzgCZ4xwByLMTKdonUk0svj1891xLMVdgXEMUcpp4XIqYx7oMBqu4EslN6QjPQ_n_O49a7C6xWDLgLabsTWQS0K0Co6n0lo6erdWcNiac?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiKOpmmxP4FGEnxkZzh3OoozjSvGCoJ165LO95CbWnriVjPvxIq7IFlRiy5EQHXISdu9WgsBRehf0i32r8_8Mu1T8rDiCWrQ2iblBdDJQ-lEdGiJb-Qz9r1G0FBcXYtKekp3xVN4BsvLH1mEiWNVPzU_Or_kUTibTMmkN5Zd7Jub1e-zDf-O6pWJKMbPMupGhmsfqVUOxDdCvBxuLzs5LQGARLW15f4BI-l--Uame4vBv9nrLbQcBiR