      <Placemark>
        <name>La Bella Swiss Inn</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZim0WHns7uwA2YLOM2QIKw8oF298IX5BGzEgB8Sd7d6WeVmOT1UE9YXpLQRCKXXa00MJQafFSgV6wsMgas5HZ1hJc9UyszbWjCxOE3zmRrBbr3cHv17wEBWlw0t9xAoKI617E0VW5UyME_UZnKnoiM-Y_PeVq1gHNXEztDKlcNO6tjBMgJim7QsITIPfG4BDS3-K0AnJ56y565SxUmlE0uaMR0AcKd_Q01uv2lmT2XgbF25KhiD4KbHeyU?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Contact No: 0968 683 4190                                      La Bella Swiss Inn. A cozy, homey in just steps from the beach, offering comfy air-conditioned rooms with private bathrooms, free Wi-Fi, private beach access, and a restaurant and bar with home-cooked meals. Enjoy free parking, room service, and friendly, helpful hosts who can arrange transfers and tours to make your stay easy and relaxed.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjV0_cAGfhn_y1w1k9EvXVQfy2nDDgNrsvO1NgMLp3wxdY5TuImSYD97EDBULJC3EPvLoS19i1bdj7_ITfunoC4V3EDupbcWnevoz0ZvjRaIpbWWbJa8Egv6_KctjE2gNx6JMRBPIKCmZeE5LHqkoYb89n28s3FJUmsRtfhCD7oZQt45ub8cXTmvtGk7YA8dNSEYOOmJAS99GB0h8UYK6mljNZOtl8uenX6DlvqFNpdkDpjciTEzuHOvHg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZgXalt72gwgxcvExcMiw54PMRW2C77kq08KFJzFFw-pbYW-5zMSIc5qjUKs7Eo7krLedL5qLgWbUYshECbiszuo3uwD3lwyQ54QVgFNJUDQGWYmDJimWY7fuVgEXMEri5NECDWPeROcEzrcgm6LYqiARVxVC-GJ62_kUv09013dlyumeXx6rKI-KCKIYz9hej8U_HgeKRz-e3AhavS2Qz69H_P3yS1CIvON5k36RlFFLqwk2yr358aEvs4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZh-efolRxh0_VpCCBnVll3gzvUJOxcqLIECM8rsT8HZsBy-d3-V5yUIyvpQs7AlPHs-h4pjX2J8uQjTCrgkwNvGKrvU0Fleji489QPW17d6qcAncuxlxk7HHGmnvjAkr-xHyNxaH-jzr2WHialffkN3tEBT9dtnZrqR0XzUDJoFCIYRJdF75ZQNgdM8BoSXVs9UjESPmvzBa1NlJJMUc7BtApxyvk5bMYU_SjNkvtJB-Lr-5JGEJpNjK-Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.userconte