      <Placemark>
        <name>Turtle Beach Resort and Restaurant</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiv6V-enqdgvEQxNjFeSlDZH7lgkiUV8NKrNED4U7zUPxQaHwDHYsg_AkHFSaxckP7jPX7WHW3ahbsZp2Ay7etraetGPvfPMqkFYRGFyyrnZz426DfBdGfPgh4L9lXTm976W8lriAqYbaq-vgkWvH-9J0w-n_x59UJfDIJG7_JdgY2yHBY-nd_oTF46Fmswx_z-BNr3KvQlpLqVRDcFJIhH8ZTTW4b9acyA68bB4MUWw7PBYz0xl1PBYgM?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Contact No: 0930 073 4586                                      Our spacious beachfront bungalow is located in the village of Alimanguan near St-Vicente. Our beach is called Turtle Beach as those wonderful creatures can be seen on our property during hatching season. We also have a smaller bungalow available on our private property and a restaurant specializing in homemade pizza, pasta, freshly caught fish and Philipino dishes. Good for a family vacation<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZhUOJktNLKKLOiVETswmHWUxmfm_CRZ1rMfqF1lpsx9seNOuQZ0kgHHAUsJnOy3L4TI6I_1JHGZa97tyiM8X0Mmu0cgHvbxaXaVJcnsMdsXZgFGQNrYHZfP-xpCBq60lfaSPbeWCC-E4V0DDsLpdjvIFKbgx7anEIkZ8h2hl9tBEQAr76iwbTFhbzvctSg8I43EAAhGUKIDiqd9_WcRFhRGTu0S-zOYRTsnshkw45AxA-UAciReZO0euv4?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiQ4VlPwcukVOQF6luAfxJS0Pfj-TOxFrzYMCVq09dgPmVCHQqs186Je8pjG0yBBvAd8e7ixhftCiobRGU107R9byyV5AySs2NQxTJ_p9Zr_-8sjdTDquf8WXEf7FmCdeF5CCR-Q5B02_gvs8Zv2udIE2hyBMAaJ4-FnqHxjfln2z_wgDP5xpMGYyJUE5WNOncrfZUiswVKnp2krQDilDZ1cPjFzsz7GxdQ7KT52cEMxb_-cClWRnk_USw?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiTkPHKGa6W9zogmClPDIa-lPflugd3lamYMepGA08nrFKDC_4oSKWvJDFPHnyekdf2KJkNbcvzCQKHP6nxwi2q-Dgcz9N_xmom9VcAuyo1K7mZA-c2OlhwJFt-_es1sxy3wSMOdwXT7lVmZXPLpjTdwMz0Xzh98PY9spzBgTtso8JtNwv2rqPN07UWmIGVZjTSCbQQqlMaXHxa3jWIFPfEhLJhLxSTMLz-qXx-Ya3CpxkVgfD48egf9tI?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" widt