      <Placemark>
        <name>Victoria Beach House</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZjjNBCDVJZGSuuIX7Au3apNbIm64njkl6Hjk-gFy7AVZHsH8nkpJAGIq56jRGrhag7uFR-Kxrhg0V2BWFBpbKibh0hsNP5hdG7Bnbb79syfv5mQu3zBB3BO0NHc2znACEKh3hwZAOfqej1Ycq5b9FMVpOhAHa9gFlXU7JkPllxJNgEeydEU2NVU3XECmWYIJvlCIQ3pVA0KmsuDddNzmEuK3_IbVI8dIiKpVImWhbfeDnA3mqoL69uogSs?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Victoria Beach House offers accommodation along the 14.7km long White Beach in San Vicente, Palawan. Located on the northwestern side of the mainland, views of the sunset can be enjoyed.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZghKlOhxQkaTbojecAb1QujRZj3eJm6XwtcARSwnh9Dl0bXnN8JlEWZfXroQO65L4omod3vjRB1w1d_LbuzkYg3ec-RQpnb5VmPEwX_gLBTm5MPQgRiNk25BbSJmLkWKuGIPsB8mNB1cOG32-52Su9a_CsBRa_mfvK9F9eokssxJcSwi08vh1JYeTfE45GQI7ANLeYTMYF2VmOKgpmQtFCzdYSucAaTzhzDhgobXUKYOy7vwUeKQNgMhgw?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZiKEkofi2cOsXYrx258j6__WAqM9FK2NL1f0RpzPDL0Ba0eHTxEaDeI1eFeAbdsuCkzJZSXyi89w-qm44jMowGikF2OH1kcjoOfGBLjqFREC56tngLIiai6hVtnBZ05aSWIsEpH4yc2oQNslwm5qkDxTH158u45tcZDO3cH2gA3NcIW9b9_issrlz_Mjmv18Qv-8BN6x9ECkDIgIb4NDTVQzS3JRQ0AfkHNuE_1CUxJQ7oZBFnIHVahQ1U?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZidoo8K96njG3D5gQbICchEq2CI6mjcCIihenjBzFRHYsXliCJZU66kF7WaypJyUztsQaVjnzuD-3hE2tqzy5GnbIKgGRJL1iSl7E0yPOWPR_EPHJHxaG9V5jmpwLn5nK6zS4A_3GsqRb9opXFKdkzpv9ABoyuA6Yd1lyPLcmdM_CIzPAOQvks16Jny4pZlkr4GAQlrA6THQTiEngtJJ1uMvS2N4f6oGNL0zaCBtSqEWh3Q6x2x1dPoExI?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ABkJAZh9jtQl2mAUxzZeL2NgUI6FtHV1vL3GyZIZmrMXuP2hfFNzoE_B9JO4KZcpqz8GmLOff0A5foEOfWXx4uva2tuAcNu1gxa5_gR5mJAMts-y_W3y3gzhFeYDMVdQp0b6mFsFqRzAi6cjIB0OZo1RSG3QoN40Q4Rwaj0J6WW0LW_s-A0pOvfg4TN